    <ol>
      <li><strong>Card</strong> — max 400px, centered on a plain page, 1px border, generous padding; the only surface. No top bar, no nav — auth is a pre-app screen.</li>
      <li><strong>Title + subtitle</strong> — "Sign in" plus one line of context; the card's <code>h1</code> doubles as the page heading.</li>
      <li><strong>Fields</strong> — <code>fl-field</code>: label above, bordered input; the label wraps the input so clicking it focuses.</li>
